  "content": "<h1 style=\"text-align:center\">使用以下模组：</h1><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1207952/description_fc0d694e-f74d-48dd-933d-72900767d08c.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"195\" height=\"195\"></strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>L_Ender 的天启</strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1207952/description_a871695f-8613-46cc-9d2c-eae3b7012277.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"199\" height=\"199\"></strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>更深更暗</strong></p><p style=\"text-align:left\">我为守卫者盔甲添加了锻造台升级配方，可将其升级为燃素盔甲和咒素盔甲。这样你就能保留原有的附魔效果。对于希望在模组间实现平滑过渡的玩家来说，这是完美的补充。</p><ul>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\">新增配方请查看图片！</li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\">无需前置模组！</li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\">仅包含锻造配方！</li>\n</ul><h1 style=\"text-align:center\">兼容以下模组：</h1><p style=\"text-align:left\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1207952/description_1a1659a6-c4e1-4ac8-a280-6cb83d11f7c8.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"125\" height=\"116\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>天启武器扩展！</strong></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><img style=\"font-weight:400;display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1207952/description_3225d611-c241-46f7-bb3a-2f2af08ef759.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"126\" height=\"118\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>天启工具扩展！</strong></p><p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
